{"id":"tuda","lemma":"туда","pos":"adv","rank":176,"glosses":["there, that way, thither"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/09/Ru-%D1%82%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ты должен пойти туда немедленно.","en":"You must go there immediately.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1267781","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"must, have to"},{"g":"to go"},null,{"g":"immediately"}]},{"text":"Положи это туда.","en":"Put it there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1236504","words":[{"g":"to put","l":"положить"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Могу я пойти туда сейчас?","en":"Can I go there now?","words":[{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go"},null,{"g":"now"}]},{"text":"Зачем вы туда пошли?","en":"Why did you go there?","words":[{"g":"why, what for"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"}]},{"text":"Я боюсь туда ехать.","en":"I'm afraid to go there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274699","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to fear, to be afraid","l":"бояться"},null,{"g":"to go"}]}]}